<title>INDIA: Indian sugar trade closed for Jain festival.</title>
<headline>Indian sugar trade closed for Jain festival.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian sugar markets remained shut on Tuesday after Monday's holiday for local religious festivals, dealers said. They reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>On the last trading day on Friday, Indian sugar prices weakened as reports of the government increasing the free sale quota for October swept the markets, they said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
